भविष्याणि च भूतानि मां तु वेद न कश्चन ॥ २६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2315,\"bb\":2052,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/26/b2052/\",\"body_value\":\"vedāhaṁ samatītāni
